# Nostalgia Radio — local environment template.
# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill in. Never commit real keys.
#
# Supabase is optional: without these the site runs fully offline on the local
# request store (tests, demo, CI never need a network or a database) and
# `/admin` renders an honest "not configured" gate instead of a login form.
# Dashboard → Project Settings → API Keys → publishable (anon) key ONLY.
# NEVER put a service_role / secret key in a Vite env var: VITE_* is bundled
# into the browser and every visitor would receive it.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
